  "footer_blank_columns_note": "the whole footer row of this leaf carries THREE figures and no others - 116 under TOTAL, 25 under agriculture and 31 under navigation of canals, lakes and rivers. The twelve slaves columns, the other five industry columns, the pensioners, the ten deaf/dumb/blind/insane columns and the seven schools columns are unfooted, and no line of the sheet carries an entry in any of them."
